      "content": "i get the support thing, but it just feels so fake. like, even the therapists just want me to \"cope\" so i can go back out there and keep suffering. it's like they're asking me to just find a way to be okay with being miserable. but what if there isn't a way? what if the only way to actually be at peace is to just... not do this anymore?",
